flowchart LR
    ingest[EventIngest fanout] --> pending[Delivery pending]
    pending -->|atomic claim lease| claimed[Claimed work]
    claimed -->|partner returns 2xx| succeeded[Delivery succeeded]
    claimed -->|terminal response, exhausted Attempts,<br/>or MaxAge expiry| dead[Delivery dead]
    claimed -->|retryable failure| retry[Delivery failed_retry]
    claimed -->|claim lease expires| pending
    retry -->|retry delay elapses| pending

    claim_note[Claimed means a delivery_claims row,<br/>not a deliveries.status value]
    claim_note -. explains .-> claimed
